msgid ""
"When the same user ran the next cell with the same environment as above, it "
"took 2min 19s in Wall Time.  Executing a circuit on a fake device invokes "
"noisy simulation which takes much longer time than exact simulation.   We "
"recommend you not execute a larger circuit (such as a 27-qubit $\\times$ 9 "
